WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.192
A translation slides every point the same distance and direction without turning or

00:00:05.192 --> 00:00:06.344
resizing the shape.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:13.466
Translate point (-4, -2) by (4, 3). What is its new x-coordinate? The answer is 0.

00:00:13.466 --> 00:00:18.165
Add plus 4 to the original x-coordinate -4: new x is 0.

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:25.073
A point during a reading competition moves from (-1, -2) by -1 squares horizontally

00:00:25.073 --> 00:00:30.681
and -2 vertically. What is its new x-coordinate? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:31.533 --> 00:00:37.765
A point during a reading competition moves from (-1, -2) by -1 squares horizontally

00:00:37.765 --> 00:00:44.887
and -2 vertically. What is its new x-coordinate? The answer is -2. Add -1 to the

00:00:44.887 --> 00:00:48.003
original x-coordinate -1: new x is -2.
